# Git mailmap: normalises contributor identities.
#
# This repository has one person committing under two identities, both using
# contact@itzdanti.dev:
#
#   itzdanti       <contact@itzdanti.dev>   (local gitconfig)
#   akinari (aki)  <contact@itzdanti.dev>   (GitHub web UI uses the display name)
#
# `git log --format=%aN/%aE` (and therefore .github/scripts/add_authors.py)
# respects this file, so both collapse into the single canonical entry below.
#
# Format: Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

akinari (aki) <pts@itzdanti.dev> itzdanti <contact@itzdanti.dev>
akinari (aki) <pts@itzdanti.dev> akinari (aki) <contact@itzdanti.dev>
